---
const phone = '3107285035';
const phoneClean = phone.replace(/\D/g, '');
const whatsappUrl = `https://wa.me/57${phoneClean}`;
---

<section class="py-20 md:py-32 bg-surface-container-low" id="expertise">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 md:gap-20">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black font-headline text-primary-container leading-tight mb-8">
          Enfoque Directo <br /> y Efectivo
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
          <div class="group">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-2">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shadow-sm group-hover:bg-secondary group-hover:text-white transition-all">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold font-headline text-primary-container">Estrategia Penal</h4>
                <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Defensa técnica especializada en cada etapa del proceso penal, garantizando el debido proceso.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="group">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-2">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shadow-sm group-hover:bg-secondary group-hover:text-white transition-all">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="text-xl font-bold font-headline text-primary-container">Derecho Procesal</h4>
                <p class="text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">Manejo experto de la normativa procesal penal vigente para la protección de sus derechos fundamentales.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-white/50">
          <p class="text-lg italic text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-8">
            "La justicia no es solo un fin, es un camino que requiere conocimiento técnico absoluto y una ética inquebrantable. Mi compromiso es proporcionar una representación que trascienda la simple defensa."
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="h-[2px] w-12 bg-secondary"></div>
            <span class="font-bold text-primary-container tracking-tighter">JUAN FELIPE RESTREPO SÁNCHEZ</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="absolute -bottom-8 -left-8 bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg">
          <span class="text-3xl font-black block">UPB</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Especialista Certificado</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>